DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
7775::$$$message_0054_0000_0000$$$::"Wha..."[lr]::
7776::$$$message_0054_0000_0001$$$::While walking on the forest path, I sense magical energy that doesn't belong here.[lr]::
7777::$$$message_0054_0000_0002$$$::...It's like poison leaking from a jar that someone made sure to seal as tightly as possible.[lr]::
7778::$$$message_0054_0000_0003$$$::This energy signature coming from below the mountain, beyond the trees, must be...::
7779::$$$message_0054_0001_0000$$$::"...Underground. Is the cavern active again...!?"[lr]::
7780::$$$message_0054_0001_0001$$$::The Greater Grail should have collapsed. How could it be working again!?::
7781::$$$message_0054_0002_0000$$$::"Why in the[line len=2]damn, of course they would!"[lr]::
7782::$$$message_0054_0002_0001$$$::If someone's restarted the Holy Grail War, then the cavern is an obvious place to start.[lr]::
7783::$$$message_0054_0002_0002$$$::I felt safe knowing it was destroyed, but if the mastermind can repair the Greater Grail...::
7784::$$$message_0054_0003_0000$$$::"Haah, haah, haah...!"[lr]::
7785::$$$message_0054_0003_0001$$$::I run through the subterranean cave.[lr]::
7786::$$$message_0054_0003_0002$$$::This is an emergency. There's no time to return home.[lr]::
7787::$$$message_0054_0003_0003$$$::I can call Saber after I've found whoever's responsible.[lr]::
7788::$$$message_0054_0003_0004$$$::If it comes down to it, I'll use my last Command Spell to summon her to my side.[lr]::
7789::$$$message_0054_0003_0005$$$::But...::
7790::$$$message_0054_0004_0000$$$::"...This is Ryudou Temple. I don't know if I can forcibly summon her here...!"[lr]::
7791::$$$message_0054_0004_0001$$$::...There's no time.[lr]::
7792::$$$message_0054_0004_0002$$$::I need to stop whoever's trying to pry the lid off that hellish cauldron before the Greater Grail moves again!::
7793::$$$message_0054_0005_0000$$$::"...!"[lr]::
7794::$$$message_0054_0005_0001$$$::Light is leaking from the Greater Grail.[lr]::
7795::$$$message_0054_0005_0002$$$::But it's still weak.[lr]::
7796::$$$message_0054_0005_0003$$$::Similar to someone using a match to light a damp fireplace.[lr]::
7797::$$$message_0054_0005_0004$$$::That means there's still time to stop it!::
7798::$$$message_0054_0006_0000$$$::"Haah, ah...!"[lr]::
7799::$$$message_0054_0006_0001$$$::I run up the cliff without stopping...[lr]::
7800::$$$message_0054_0006_0002$$$::...and arrive at a ledge overlooking the infernal pit deep below.[lr]::
7801::$$$message_0054_0006_0003$$$::This is the source of the wish-granter that causes calamity.[lr]::
7802::$$$message_0054_0006_0004$$$::And in front of its fell husk...::
7803::$$$message_0054_0007_0000$$$::"Fuhahahaha! I was curious what was here. How wretched it looks now![lr]::
7804::$$$message_0054_0007_0001$$$::It amounted to little more than a talentless dullard's vision of a golden city. Hardly worth my time!"[lr]::
7805::$$$message_0054_0007_0002$$$::...I spot a man wahaha-ing about how amazing and cool the vista is.::
7806::$$$message_0054_0008_0000$$$::"Ah..."[lr]::
7807::$$$message_0054_0008_0001$$$::Everything's fine.[lr]::
7808::$$$message_0054_0008_0002$$$::I don't know what he's doing, but nothing bad will happen if I leave this alone.::
7809::$$$message_0054_0009_0000$$$::"Oh? If it isn't Saber's cupbearer.[lr]::
7810::$$$message_0054_0009_0001$$$::How thoughtful of you, mongrel, to appear just as I was in need of a guide!"[lr]::
7811::$$$message_0054_0009_0002$$$::"..."::
7812::$$$message_0054_0010_0000$$$::Annnd he's seen me.[lr]::
7813::$$$message_0054_0010_0001$$$::I don't have the stamina to leave after the effort of racing here.[lr]::
7814::$$$message_0054_0010_0002$$$::...By the way, I wish he'd stop implying that all I do is bring her meals.::
7815::$$$message_0054_0011_0000$$$::"Well, never mind that.[lr]::
7816::$$$message_0054_0011_0001$$$::Gilgamesh, you're..."[lr]::
7817::$$$message_0054_0011_0002$$$::The perv[line len=2]I mean, golden Servant is in a form that I haven't seen him in before.::
7818::$$$message_0054_0012_0000$$$::"Hm? [cacheimage storage=ギル旧私服01b(遠)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=400 storage=ギル旧私服01b(遠)]Ah, yes, I'm not in my juvenile form.[lr]::
7819::$$$message_0054_0012_0001$$$::Just for now, I've had a change of heart and returned to my usual self.[lr]::
7820::$$$message_0054_0012_0002$$$::I thought you'd all be lonely without the protagonist here. Consider it a small gesture of my royal grace."::
7821::$$$message_0054_0013_0000$$$::Another delighted, haughty chuckle erupts from the King of Heroes.[lr]::
7822::$$$message_0054_0013_0001$$$::I see. It isn't that he couldn't turn back; he just didn't want to until now.[lr]::
7823::$$$message_0054_0013_0002$$$::...Urgh, you really don't appreciate what you have until it's gone.[lr]::
7824::$$$message_0054_0013_0003$$$::That golden boy was [font italic=true]such[font italic=false] a decent kid compared to this guy!::
7825::$$$message_0054_0014_0000$$$::"Right... Well, anyway...[lr]::
7826::$$$message_0054_0014_0001$$$::Hey, what's with those clothes?"[lr]::
7827::$$$message_0054_0014_0002$$$::"Hm?"[lr]::
7828::$$$message_0054_0014_0003$$$::Gilgamesh checks his clothes, as if I told him that trash is stuck to it.::
7829::$$$message_0054_0015_0000$$$::"What? There's nothing wrong with what I'm wearing."[lr]::
7830::$$$message_0054_0015_0001$$$::Right.[lr]::
7831::$$$message_0054_0015_0002$$$::Nothing wrong at all, sure.[lr]::
7832::$$$message_0054_0015_0003$$$::This whole situation is so bizarre that his outfit is barely worth mentioning.::
7833::$$$message_0054_0016_0000$$$::"Then, is that a new favorite outfit?"[lr]::
7834::$$$message_0054_0016_0001$$$::"Very perceptive, mongrel.[lr]::
7835::$$$message_0054_0016_0002$$$::I wasn't going to mention it, but it seems my regal aura simply cannot be contained."[lr]::
7836::$$$message_0054_0016_0003$$$::Oh, is that what he calls it?::
7837::$$$message_0054_0017_0000$$$::"Indeed, this is my formal attire.[lr]::
7838::$$$message_0054_0017_0001$$$::It is a rare artifact, one of the few that may only be worn by those specially chosen.[lr]::
7839::$$$message_0054_0017_0002$$$::In the main plot, it was locked away by the curse of 'Too Embarrassing to Show, So Scrap It,' but it is nothing at all to be ashamed of.[lr]::
7840::$$$message_0054_0017_0003$$$::...So rare, in fact, that there was only enough budget to draw me wearing it in one pose."::
7841::$$$message_0054_0018_0000$$$::A cocky snicker escapes his lips.[lr]::
7842::$$$message_0054_0018_0001$$$::If you haven't noticed, his definition of rare is way off base.::
7843::$$$message_0054_0019_0000$$$::"So...[lr]::
7844::$$$message_0054_0019_0001$$$::What are you actually doing here?"[lr]::
7845::$$$message_0054_0019_0002$$$::"Studying and recording.[lr]::
7846::$$$message_0054_0019_0003$$$::I am the man who obtained everything in the world. The world would be in disarray if there was a part of it I did not know.[lr]::
7847::$$$message_0054_0019_0004$$$::Thus I am here. I'm not interested in the pits of the earth, but it is my royal duty to inspect it."::
7848::$$$message_0054_0020_0000$$$::The king's delighted expression betrays his supposed disinterest.[lr]::
7849::$$$message_0054_0020_0001$$$::I bet that deep down, he just has a thing for high places and giant buildings.[lr]::
7850::$$$message_0054_0020_0002$$$::"I see. So this place isn't actually connected to you."[lr]::
7851::$$$message_0054_0020_0003$$$::Even though you're a boss character?::
7852::$$$message_0054_0021_0000$$$::"The stars simply weren't aligned this time. It is no fault of mine. What is a king without an ego?[lr]::
7853::$$$message_0054_0021_0001$$$::What Saber fails to grasp is that modesty and thrift are virtues to be enjoyed by the common rabble. If she would only join my army, I would shower her in riches untold.[lr]::
7854::$$$message_0054_0021_0002$$$::By the way, mongrel. I see you're holding something quite unusual."::
7855::$$$message_0054_0022_0000$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
7856::$$$message_0054_0022_0001$$$::Something unusual?[lr]::
7857::$$$message_0054_0022_0002$$$::"Um, I'm not carrying anything."[lr]::
7858::$$$message_0054_0022_0003$$$::"You've only forgotten, but it belongs to you nonetheless.[lr]::
7859::$$$message_0054_0022_0004$$$::...Hm. It doesn't look to be of much value, but I'll allow it. In any case, it doesn't exist in my treasury."::
7860::$$$message_0054_0023_0000$$$::"Huh!?"[lr]::
7861::$$$message_0054_0023_0001$$$::I feel like something important just got stolen from under my nose!::
7862::$$$message_0054_0024_0000$$$::"Wait, what did you just do!?"[lr]::
7863::$$$message_0054_0024_0001$$$::"I transferred its ownership to me.[lr]::
7864::$$$message_0054_0024_0002$$$::...Hmm. It seems to be some kind of game. Wait right there. I'll make it easier for you to understand.[lr]::
7865::$$$message_0054_0024_0003$$$::It's been a long time since I appraised something of unknown origin. Let me amuse myself."::
7866::$$$message_0054_0025_0000$$$::Gilgamesh closes his eyes in thought.[lr]::
7867::$$$message_0054_0025_0001$$$::A few minutes later...[lr]::
7868::$$$message_0054_0025_0002$$$::With a smug chuckle of understanding, Gilgamesh draws a card out of the space behind him.::
7869::$$$message_0054_0026_0000$$$::"So that's what it is. Rather uninteresting once given meaning.[lr]::
7870::$$$message_0054_0026_0001$$$::But here is your reward. Take it."[lr]::
7873::$$$message_0054_0026_0004$$$::"Is this a...hanafuda card? Can I really have it?"[lr]::
7874::$$$message_0054_0026_0005$$$::"I said it's your reward. I don't mind giving it away, as long as I have the original.[lr]::
7875::$$$message_0054_0026_0006$$$::It was developed and completed into a product which should be passed down to the mortal world, after all."[wvs][clfg textoff=0 pos=all rule=シャッター左から time=400]::
7876::$$$message_0054_0027_0000$$$::A vainglorious proclamation.[lr]::
7878::$$$message_0054_0027_0002$$$::The King of Heroes has apparently come all this way to add to his collection.[lr]::
7879::$$$message_0054_0027_0003$$$::"Now to resume my sightseeing. What is happening down below?"[lr]::
7880::$$$message_0054_0027_0004$$$::He's already dismissed me from his attention.::
7881::$$$message_0054_0028_0000$$$::"Ah. Hey, it's dangerous![lr]::
7882::$$$message_0054_0028_0001$$$::Don't go down there!"[lr]::
7883::$$$message_0054_0028_0002$$$::"Hahaha. What are you talking about? It's just a crater.[lr]::
7884::$$$message_0054_0028_0003$$$::I see some mud here and there, but no matter. Don't stop me. Why, I spy something fascinating in the center..."::
7885::$$$message_0054_0029_0000$$$::The arrogant king strides into the pit, throwing caution to the wind.[lr]::
7886::$$$message_0054_0029_0001$$$::But he has no idea what's waiting for him.[lr]::
7887::$$$message_0054_0029_0002$$$::Man, it's the home base of the one thing [font italic=true]you[font italic=false] of all people shouldn't get careless around. That's why it ate you last time!::
7888::$$$message_0054_0030_0000$$$::"Mm? Hmmm? Mmmrgh!?[lr]::
7889::$$$message_0054_0030_0001$$$::Wait. What is this filth sticking to my feet? How revolting. I have a bad feeling about this.[lr]::
7890::$$$message_0054_0030_0002$$$::You there, mongrel. Here's my chain. Hold it."::
7891::$$$message_0054_0031_0000$$$::The bad feeling snowballs into a replay of the past.[lr]::
7892::$$$message_0054_0031_0001$$$::He might have started over from childhood, but his fate is playing out the same way.[lr]::
7893::$$$message_0054_0031_0002$$$::Apparently, with great power comes great irresponsibility.::
7894::$$$message_0054_0032_0000$$$::"Ooooohhhh?[lr]::
7895::$$$message_0054_0032_0001$$$::I can't escape even with the Chain of the Heavens!? Inconceivable! [lr]::
7896::$$$message_0054_0032_0002$$$::Damn it all, this is no freak plane crash or precipice of fate! Behold the power of my wealth! Fight, my friend! Do your utmost to [font italic=true]save my life![font italic=false]"::
7897::$$$message_0054_0033_0000$$$::The King of Heroes tethers himself to the Greater Grail, just barely holding on.[lr]::
7898::$$$message_0054_0033_0001$$$::By the way, the friend he's talking to isn't me, but the chain.::
7899::$$$message_0054_0034_0000$$$::"Uh... Well, I guess I'll move on.[lr]::
7900::$$$message_0054_0034_0001$$$::See you next time, if you're still alive."[lr]::
7901::$$$message_0054_0034_0002$$$::"Are you just going to watch!?[lr]::
7902::$$$message_0054_0034_0003$$$::As a humble citizen, surely you'll do something!"::
7903::$$$message_0054_0035_0000$$$::"Then I'll go find help. In my case, that would be Saber, though. Is that all right with you?"[lr]::
7904::$$$message_0054_0035_0001$$$::"Ha ha ha.[lr]::
7905::$$$message_0054_0035_0002$$$::...No need. I require no aid at all![lr]::
7906::$$$message_0054_0035_0003$$$::This is like[line len=2]how do you say[line len=2]like climbing a jungle gym.[lr]::
7907::$$$message_0054_0035_0004$$$::A trifle hardly deserving assistance. You hear me? Whatever you do, do not tell Saber."::
7908::$$$message_0054_0036_0000$$$::He lets out an imperious snort.[lr]::
7909::$$$message_0054_0036_0001$$$::Even as he asserts the virtue of self-sufficiency, Gilgamesh's lower half is stuck in the mud, while his upper half is bound up in the Chain of the Heavens.[lr]::
7910::$$$message_0054_0036_0002$$$::Wow, what a cool guy.[lr]::
7911::$$$message_0054_0036_0003$$$::I never thought someone could look so dashing trapped between a rock and a hard place.::
7912::$$$message_0054_0037_0000$$$::"Okay. I'll leave it at that.[lr]::
7913::$$$message_0054_0037_0001$$$::Thank you for the hanafuda card."[lr]::
7914::$$$message_0054_0037_0002$$$::"Uh-huh. One more thing: it's part of a pair. Its counterpart is somewhere out in the world. If you ever encounter the person holding it, that is when it will show its true worth.[lr]::
7915::$$$message_0054_0037_0003$$$::Take heed, mongrel. They await you at the ends of the earth. Once you obtain the other card, confrontation will be inevitable..."::
7916::$$$message_0054_0038_0000$$$::I leave the cavern with his wise, mysterious warning in mind.[lr]::
7917::$$$message_0054_0038_0001$$$::Now, then...[lr]::
7918::$$$message_0054_0038_0002$$$::I think he'll manage to hold out not just for a day, but a whole year.[lr]::
7919::$$$message_0054_0038_0003$$$::When I have time, I should find Lancer and ask him to bail the poor guy out.::
907810::$$$message_9054_0009_0001$$$::"How thoughtful of you, mongrel, to appear just as I was in need of a guide!"::

